# ⚠ NEVER commit the Apps Script backend to this repo.
#
# GitHub Pages serves everything here at orders.indiabusinessinternational.online,
# so a committed .gs is a public download — anyone could read the whole server
# logic and every spreadsheet ID in it. Verified HTTP 200 before this change.
#
# The .gs stays a LOCAL MIRROR in the working folder and is deployed by pasting it
# into the Apps Script editor. That workflow does not change.
#
# The same rule (and the same fix) already applies to IBI Stock Availability and
# the IBI eCommerce Marketplace.
IBI-Order-Processing-Code.gs
IBI-Order-Processing-appsscript.json
*.gs
